<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Detail Project - Personal Web</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/css/detail.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #25D366;
            --dark-bg: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --text-main: #1e293b;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
        }
        body.dark {
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-main: #f1f5f9;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            background-color: var(--dark-bg);
        }
        * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--text-main);
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }
        a.back-btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 600;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .project-header h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .project-meta {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
        .project-banner {
            width: 100%;
            height: 450px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .project-banner img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .project-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
        }
        .content-section h2 { margin-bottom: 15px; font-size:1.5rem; }
        .content-section p { margin-bottom: 20px; color: var(--text-muted); }
        .sidebar-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            position: sticky;
            top: 20px;
        }
        .sidebar-card h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .tech-list { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:25px; }
        .tech-tag {
            background: rgba(37,211,102,0.1);
            color: var(--primary-color);
            padding:5px 12px;
            border-radius:20px;
            font-size:0.8rem;
            font-weight:600;
        }
        .action-btns .btn {
            display:block;
            text-align:center;
            padding:12px;
            border-radius:10px;
            text-decoration:none;
            font-weight:600;
            margin-bottom:10px;
            transition:0.3s;
        }
        .btn.primary { background: var(--primary-color); color:white; }
        .btn.outline { border:2px solid #e2e8f0; color: var(--text-main); }
        .btn:hover { opacity:0.9; transform: translateY(-2px); }
        @media(max-width:768px){
            .project-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
            .project-banner { height:250px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Portfolio</a>

        <header class="project-header">
            <h1>Personal Website & Blog</h1>
            <div class="project-meta">
                <span>📅 Jan 2024</span>
                <span>📂 Web Development</span>
                <span>🔗 version 2.0</span>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="project-banner">
            <img src="/styles/image/cat2.jpg" alt="Project Preview">
        </div>

        <div class="project-grid">
            <div class="content-section">
                <h2>Project Overview</h2>
                <p>
                    Website portofolio pribadi untuk memamerkan karya & pengalaman sebagai Full-stack Developer. Fokus utama: performance & kemudahan manajemen konten.
                </p>

                <h2>Key Features</h2>
                <ul style="margin-left:20px; color:var(--text-muted); margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <li>Dark & Light mode toggle.</li>
                    <li>Sistem blogging menggunakan Markdown.</li>
                    <li>Integrasi API WhatsApp untuk kontak.</li>
                    <li>Desain sepenuhnya responsif.</li>
                </ul>

                <h2>Challenges & Solutions</h2>
                <p>
                    Optimisasi gambar agar website cepat dibuka, menggunakan <i>lazy loading</i> & kompresi otomatis.
                </p>
            </div>

            <aside>
                <div class="sidebar-card">
                    <h3>Technologies</h3>
                    <div class="tech-list">
                        <span class="tech-tag">Node.js</span>
                        <span class="tech-tag">Express</span>
                        <span class="tech-tag">PostgreSQL</span>
                        <span class="tech-tag">Handlebars</span>
                        <span class="tech-tag">Bootstrap</span>
                    </div>

                    <h3>Project Links</h3>
                    <div class="action-btns">
                        <a href="#" class="btn primary">View Live De
